# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Fifth Ave AI — Environment Variable Reference
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This file documents all required variables. It is committed to version control
# with placeholder values only. Never put real keys here.
#
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT
# -----------------
# 1. Copy this file:
#      cp .env.example .env.local        (for Next.js build-time vars)
#      cp .env.example .dev.vars         (for Cloudflare Pages Functions)
#    Then fill in real values in those copies.
# 2. Build the site:   npm run build
# 3. Run locally:      npx wrangler pages dev out
#
# PRODUCTION
# ----------
# Set RESEND_API_KEY and TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY as Encrypted secrets in the
# Cloudflare Pages dashboard under Settings → Environment variables.
# Set the remaining variables as plain-text variables in the same place.
# Set NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY as a build-time variable in
# Cloudflare Pages → Settings → Build → Environment variables.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Next.js public build-time variable ───────────────────────────────────────
# Inlined into client JS at build time. Use the real Turnstile site key in prod.
# Cloudflare test site key (always visible, for local dev only):
#   1x00000000000000000000AA
NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=your-turnstile-site-key-here

# ── Cloudflare Pages Function secrets (server-side only) ─────────────────────
# These must NEVER appear in client code, Next.js public vars, or git history.

# Resend API key — create at resend.com/api-keys (scope: Sending access)
RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_resend_api_key_here

# Cloudflare Turnstile secret key — from dash.cloudflare.com → Turnstile
# Cloudflare test secret (always passes, for local dev only):
#   1x0000000000000000000000000000000AA
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=your-turnstile-secret-key-here

# ── Cloudflare Pages Function plain-text config ───────────────────────────────
CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=shane@fifthaveai.com
CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=Fifth Ave AI Website <website@send.fifthaveai.com>
ALLOWED_HOSTNAMES=fifthaveai.com,www.fifthaveai.com,fifthaveai.pages.dev
